  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with an **accent change in the presente**: the weak **i** takes an accent mark (í) in all singular forms and ellos/ellas/ustedes to break the diphthong and stress it separately",
    "Nosotros/nosotras is the exception: *guiamos* (no accent — stress falls naturally)",
    "All other tenses follow regular -AR patterns",
    "Past participle: *guiado* (regular)",
    "Common usage: *guiar un tour* (to lead a tour), *guiar a alguien* (to guide someone), *dejarse guiar* (to let oneself be guided)",
    "Related: *el/la guía* (the guide — person or book), *la guía turística* (tourist guide)"
  ],
